lation of waiting on a food delivery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of mundane activities to occupy your time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A toilet to block.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cult to join.</p></li></ul>",
